  "package_id": "chsh-steering-ellipsoid",
  "formal_scope": "Lean 4.19.0 proves, for every admissible centre length c and Bob length r, that an explicit complex 4×4 density matrix with centre (0, 0, c) and Bob length r has CHSH supremum over all unit Pauli settings exactly 2√(1 + (1 − 2c)(1 − r²)), without assuming the Horodecki formula, and checks a tilted axial witness, the rank-two sharpness family and the scalar spectral optimization behind the axial envelope; a whole-project audit covers every declaration. The joint bound itself is prior work; the general filter-to-Gram correspondence, the equality classification and the rigidity theorems are conventional proofs supported by exact symbolic checks.",
